{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39210","headline":"观淛西府相畋游 · 韦庄","name":"观淛西府相畋游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十里旌旗十万兵，等闲游猎出军城。\n紫袍日照金鹅鬬，红斾风吹画虎狞。\n带箭彩禽云外落，避鵰寒兔月中惊。\n归来一路笙歌满，更有僊娥载酒迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}